    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75102" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρισ-μός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>marking out by boundaries,
				limitation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ὁ. τῶν κτήσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					2.74
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκριβὴς . . οὐκ ἔστιν ὁ., ἕως τίνος
					. . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1159a4
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. τοῦ λυπεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Epit.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>boundary,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					599.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.97.11
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the definition of a thing,</i> freq. in
				<i><span class="en">Arist.,
					<u>AP</u>0.91a1</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Top.</u>
				139a26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1031a1
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>wager,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>TG</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>decree,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Da.</u>
				6.12(13)
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>vow,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				30.3
			</span></i>,al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.77
			</span></i>.</div>
